Low code project
Overview
A simple Flask web application created as part of the Low-Code/No-Code course.
The application displays a welcome message on the home page.
Requirements
Python 3
Flask 3.1.2
Installation
Create and activate a virtual environment, then install the required packages:
python3 -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
Run the application with:
python3 app.py
open http://127.0.0.1:5000 in your browser
